/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless

# Java ME runs in its own tab: CheerpJ embeds a frame from its CDN that cannot
# satisfy cross-origin isolation, so these pages drop it (nothing here needs
# SharedArrayBuffer).
/j2me/*
  ! Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy
  ! Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy
